OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy and rather wet
OL,6,Fmorning, with the heaviest rain across
OL,7,Fthe north. Rain will gradually ease
OL,8,Fheading into the afternoon, with some
OL,9,Flate spells of brightness developing.
OL,10,FBreezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FLargely dry this evening and
OL,13,Ftonight with a mix of cloud and clear
OL,14,Fspells. The cloud lowering at times
OL,15,Fgiving some hill fog and possibly
OL,16,Fdrizzle in places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
