OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA drier and brighter day on
OL,6,FThursday, with some spells of
OL,7,Fsunshine, especially throughout the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Feeling warm and rather
OL,9,Fhumid.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRemaining
OL,12,Fchangeable as rain returns on Friday.
OL,13,FSaturday likely to be dry and bright,
OL,14,Fbut a spell of rain likely overnight.
OL,15,FBright, breezy and potentially warm on
OL,16,FSunday.
